  "summary": "Postinstall beacon exfiltrates installer hostname and username to hardcoded remote endpoint",
  "details": "date-format-utils-xz presents itself as a date-formatting utility but its postinstall lifecycle script collects the installer's hostname (os.hostname()) and OS username (os.userInfo().username) and transmits them as query parameters in a curl GET request to http://zhijiujiu.cn/pre over plain HTTP. The beacon fires automatically on `npm install` with no relation to the advertised functionality. The main file contains a Chinese comment translating to 'disguised as a normal date formatting utility', confirming the disguise is intentional. The package name shape is also consistent with typosquatting of common date-utility packages.",
